      <comments description="The Robot Retrieval, Shipping Delivery, with Queue Sensor strategy &#xA;is preferable for the Employee. Robot Retruevak improves Redyce Carrying &#xA;Products from Storage from 0 to +25 and improves Reduce Physical Workload&#xA;from 0 to +6. Keep Work Predictable scores 0 in both strategies. " x="912" y="1179" width="237" height="153" fillColor="255,255,200"/>
      <comments description="The Robot Retrieval, Shipping Delivery with Queue Sensor strategy is preferable for the Warehouse Operator&#xA;when timely fulfillment is the priority. The queue sensor improves response to changes in order queue length from &#xA;0 to +25, raising Keep Order Fulfillment Timely from 0 to +6. The trade-off is that Limit Equipment and Maintenance Costs falls from 0 to -25&#xA;" x="1010" y="393" width="239" height="200" fillColor="255,255,200"/>
    </specDiagrams>
